00005:   "normal_input_domain": "Fixed R default registrations/data, ordinary valid party/battler objects and record IDs, reached ordinary EOR path; callbacks finish normally except each stated error-prefix. No plugin/concurrent mutation or corrupt data assumed. Raw registrations and their data provenance are independently read in cited units.",
00006:   "cancel": "No user cancellation UI in this fact; a failed eligibility guard means local no-op, not cancellation or rollback. Later replacement UI is a separate reached consumer.",
00007:   "id": "ERT-ITEM-PIPE",
