00023:   "meaning": [
00024:     "pbTakeEffectDamage clears halfHP marker, rounds/clamps/reduces HP (minimum1 when living), yields damage message, invokes current HP-item check, then halfHP ability, then conditional Faint, then clears marker. Healing to >=half clears the marker before halfHP callback. A fainted item holder fails ordinary itemActive; items do not revive here.",
00025:     "Ordinary held trigger checks living/currentitemActive once at entry, then HPHeal, StatusCure, EndOfMove checks; each helper rechecks living/itemActive as coded and chooses its current item. HPHeal true invokes held-triggered consumption; false ordinary route then tries terrain seeds. CheekPouch heals totalHP/3 for a triggered berry when active and canHeal before consumption. Consume may call Symbiosis and nested held checks. Forced item_to_use/positive-hit berry path is read but excluded from ordinary EOR because caller passes none.",
00026:     "HPHeal complete default family has sixteen registrations; detailed manual meanings in item_family_meanings. Success generally changes HP/stage/flag before outer consumption. StatusCure complete default family has eight; Leppa and WhiteHerb each one.",
00027:     "WhiteHerb sets every negative battle stage0 and statsRaisedThisRound true, preserving statsDropped; if none negative returnsfalse. EjectPack requires statsDropped and currentitemActive at wrapper; handler rejects SkyDrop, all foes unavailable, wild bearer, trapped/unavailable switch or no legal nonactive. It requests use/message, consumes with Symbiosis disabled, then EOR branch recalls and invokes leaving ability handling; this marks the battler hp0/fainted locally and defers replacement to later pbEORSwitch. NonEOR replacement-selection route is not applied to this fact.",
00028:     "HalfHP EmergencyExit/WimpOut first rejects SkyDrop. In a wild battle it then rejects an opposing bearer when its current living same-side battler count is greater than one, before querying escape permission. With only one current living same-side battler, that population guard passes but actual pbCanRun permission is still required. A player-side bearer is not rejected by this population guard, while the shared escape gate still applies. The count excludes nil and fainted objects and includes the living bearer. Only after reached splash/audio/flee-message requests complete does the branch write decision3. Trainer branch checks foes/switch/nonactive then EOR recalls/leaves with no immediate replacement. Remaining full escape policy and existing C0122 faint/presentation closures stay with root actual readers."
00029:   ],
00030:   "normal_and_boundary": [
00031:     "Effect damage that crosses half then Sitrus heals back to>=half: subsequent halfHP marker is false. AtHP0 ordinary itemActivefalse, then Faint reached after other helper returns.",
00032:     "Moody+WhiteHerb restores negatives and consumes; statsDropped remains true. EjectPack already held and legal trainer reserve: consumed before EOR retirement, actual replacement later. A failed switching gate leaves pack unconsumed.",
00033:     "Plain nonforced Leppa restores first zero-PP move among current persistent moves, capped totalPP and mirrors battle movePP; merely partialPP with no zeroPP does not trigger. WhiteHerb no negative stat no consume."
00034:   ],
00035:   "error_prefix": "HP is written before scene wait and damage message. Callback failure before HP-item check leaves lostHP; HP-item effect can precede its own consumption; consume ledger writes precede Symbiosis. WhiteHerb resets may precede animation/display and later consume failure. EjectPack consumes before recall/leaving handling, so a recall/callback failure can leave it consumed without completed retirement/replacement. pbFaint effects occur only if reached. No local ensure/transaction; outer diagnostic may return after reporting ordinary failure and does not repair prefix.",
00036:   "persistence_reload": "HP/status/item/PP writes persistent Pokemon; stages and per-battle ledgers runtime. Full storage identity, serializer/reload, actual scene animation and input completion are excluded from static fact, not silently passed.",
00037:   "reusable_for": [
00038:     "CORE-C0125"
00039:   ],
00040:   "reuse_scope": "Exact HP-item→halfHP→Faint pipeline plus read default item families/current gates. Root can join its already-read C0122/Scene/Pokedex contracts without creating new source or global gate."
00041: }
